The sources under sensor_client/ and sensor_server/ are derived from the
example examples/bluetooth/esp_ble_mesh/sensor_models of ESP-IDF.

Modifications with respect to the upstream example:

  - sensor_server/main/main.c
      Added the FreeRTOS task mesh_stress_test_task, which periodically
      publishes a Sensor Status message carrying a 4-byte little-endian
      application sequence number. Sensor data buffers were widened from
      1 to 5 bytes accordingly.

  - sensor_client/main/main.c
      Added runtime computation of Packet Delivery Ratio, lost-packet count
      and collision detection, based on the sequence number injected by the
      server.

  - sensor_server/main/main_server.c, sensor_server/main/main_relay.c
      Variants of the modified server used respectively for relaxed-rate
      traffic generation and for the forward-only relay node.

All original SPDX license headers have been preserved.
